DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
37818::$$$message_0269_0000_0000$$$::I promised to go to the pool with Sakura.[lr]::
37819::$$$message_0269_0000_0001$$$::Fortunately, I have a complimentary pass, and Sakura said she bought a swimsuit... Oh yeah, my swimsuit.[lr]::
37820::$$$message_0269_0000_0002$$$::Ah, found it, the one I used to use.[lr]::
37821::$$$message_0269_0000_0003$$$::"All there is left is to call for Sakura..."::
37822::$$$message_0269_0001_0000$$$::"Sakura, are you there?"[lr]::
37823::$$$message_0269_0001_0001$$$::"Yes, Senpai? Come in."[lr]::
37824::$$$message_0269_0001_0002$$$::Good, she's there.[lr]::
37825::$$$message_0269_0001_0003$$$::I control my breathing and open the door.::
37826::$$$message_0269_0002_0000$$$::"Hello. You seem rather nervous, Shirou."[lr]::
37827::$$$message_0269_0002_0001$$$::"Er..."[lr]::
37828::$$$message_0269_0002_0002$$$::...She could've told me that Rider was there too.[lr]::
37829::$$$message_0269_0002_0003$$$::Rider's landed the first blow with the sudden bull's-eye.::
37830::$$$message_0269_0003_0000$$$::"Senpai? Is something the matter?"[lr]::
37831::$$$message_0269_0003_0001$$$::"No Sakura, men should always be nervous when entering a woman's room. Written works often say becoming comfortable in romance is like rust eating away at steel[line len=2]"[lr]::
37832::$$$message_0269_0003_0002$$$::"But Senpai and I are like childhood friends."::
37833::$$$message_0269_0004_0000$$$::Sakura is considerably the oldest acquaintance of mine out of everyone here.[lr]::
37834::$$$message_0269_0004_0001$$$::We may have only started living under one roof around the same time, but Sakura and I regularly visited each other's places a long time before that.::
37835::$$$message_0269_0005_0000$$$::"Sakura, Shirou will feel excluded if you continue on like that. And Shirou, if you do not make any kind of move, Sakura will also eventually[line len=2]"[lr]::
37836::$$$message_0269_0005_0001$$$::"Wait a minute, Rider. [cacheimage storage=桜私服07d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07d(中) textoff=0]I didn't come to talk about that today; I have business with Sakura."::
37837::$$$message_0269_0006_0000$$$::"Senpai, was there something we were doing today?"[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02a(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服02a(中) textoff=0][lr]::
37838::$$$message_0269_0006_0001$$$::"Well, not yet, but about that... Are you free today, Sakura?"[lr]::
37839::$$$message_0269_0006_0002$$$::This is really frustrating. It should be easy enough to bring this up casually with Sakura, but I can't help but slowly suggest things and gauge how she reacts to it first.::
37840::$$$message_0269_0007_0000$$$::"No... Other than the usual chores, nothing really."[lr]::
37841::$$$message_0269_0007_0001$$$::"Good, good. Do you remember what we planned on doing some time ago?"[lr]::
37842::$$$message_0269_0007_0002$$$::"Umm... We were going to go shopping for a new pot?"[lr]::
37843::$$$message_0269_0007_0003$$$::"Guess there's that too, but, you know, in Shinto?"::
37844::$$$message_0269_0008_0000$$$::"A movie? ...[cacheimage storage=桜私服08g(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg storage=桜私服08g(中) pos=r time=300 textoff=0]Wait. Oh, I remember now!"[lr]::
37845::$$$message_0269_0008_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Good, so we can get going[line len=2][font italic=false][lr]::
37846::$$$message_0269_0008_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服02b頬(中) textoff=0]But just as that thought passes through my mind, Sakura goes silent and turns beet red.[lr]::
37847::$$$message_0269_0008_0003$$$::...Bingo. Seems I was on the money.::
37848::$$$message_0269_0009_0000$$$::"Uh, so I was thinking of going today... Sorry for the short notice, Sakura."[lr]::
37849::$$$message_0269_0009_0001$$$::"Oh... I see, I was also talking with Rider about what I should do today."::
37850::$$$message_0269_0010_0000$$$::So it was perfect timing.[lr]::
37851::$$$message_0269_0010_0001$$$::If I had been any slower, she might've settled on other plans. I turn my attention back to Rider.::
37852::$$$message_0269_0011_0000$$$::"My bad for not bringing this up earlier, Rider."[lr]::
37853::$$$message_0269_0011_0001$$$::"Ah... No, I don't have anything particularly important either, so if you and Sakura have plans, then I will stay or do whatever is needed."[lr]::
37854::$$$message_0269_0011_0002$$$::"You see, I was talking about going to that pool with Senpai some time ago...[cacheimage storage=桜私服07b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服07b(中) pos=r time=300 textoff=0] Do you want to come too, Rider?[lr]::
37855::$$$message_0269_0011_0003$$$::You have a swimsuit too, right?"[lr]::
37856::$$$message_0269_0011_0004$$$::"Yes, I did go with you when you went to buy one..."::
37857::$$$message_0269_0012_0000$$$::So she has been thinking about it. That's good, the odds of this happening are higher, but I suppose so would the likelihood of all three of us going too.::
37858::$$$message_0269_0013_0000$$$::"I was thinking that you should take a breather sometimes."[lr]::
37859::$$$message_0269_0013_0001$$$::"There are times when I take a break when you aren't aware, but... I suppose that's true."[lr]::
37860::$$$message_0269_0013_0002$$$::Rider alternately gazes at Sakura and me.::
37861::$$$message_0269_0014_0000$$$::"But, I think I'll pass today.[lr]::
37862::$$$message_0269_0014_0001$$$::I have gone to that pool several times, so you two should go take your time having fun today."[lr]::
37863::$$$message_0269_0014_0002$$$::"Oh... Okay. [cacheimage storage=桜私服02a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服02a(中) textoff=0]Too bad..."::
37864::$$$message_0269_0015_0000$$$::Sakura is disappointed.[lr]::
37865::$$$message_0269_0015_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01b(中) textoff=0]On the other hand, internally, I'm fist pumping.::
37866::$$$message_0269_0016_0000$$$::"...Rider, sorry for this."[lr]::
37867::$$$message_0269_0016_0001$$$::I quietly apologize in a low voice.[lr]::
37868::$$$message_0269_0016_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服13b(中) textoff=0]I would get distracted if Rider is with us. I don't think I'd completely ignore Sakura or anything, but I feel like the risk is too high...::
37869::$$$message_0269_0017_0000$$$::"...Shirou."[lr]::
37870::$$$message_0269_0017_0001$$$::Rider beckons me over.[lr]::
37871::$$$message_0269_0017_0002$$$::We huddle in the corner of the room and whisper amongst ourselves.::
37872::$$$message_0269_0018_0000$$$::"...Sakura is quite something."[lr]::
37873::$$$message_0269_0018_0001$$$::"What are we talking about here?"[lr]::
37874::$$$message_0269_0018_0002$$$::"Well, I thought I should let you know beforehand. I don't want you locked in place with nothing to say since I won't be there to help."[lr]::
37875::$$$message_0269_0018_0003$$$::"...Is this about Sakura's swimsuit?"::
37876::$$$message_0269_0019_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服04a(遠) textoff=0]I steal a glance at Sakura.[lr]::
37877::$$$message_0269_0019_0001$$$::She's looking at us, clearly unsure what it is we're talking about.[lr]::
37878::$$$message_0269_0019_0002$$$::Sakura in a swimsuit...::
37879::$$$message_0269_0020_0000$$$::"Mmm... You might be right about that.[lr]::
37880::$$$message_0269_0020_0001$$$::But, aren't you also quite something?"[lr]::
37881::$$$message_0269_0020_0002$$$::"I'm only average."[lr]::
37882::$$$message_0269_0020_0003$$$::"No way. You also have enough, well, volume that definitely would keep up with Sakura[line len=2]"[lr]::
37883::$$$message_0269_0020_0004$$$::"Us keeping up? Keeping what up?"[lr]::
37884::$$$message_0269_0020_0005$$$::It's strange. I wonder why she heard just that part.::
37885::$$$message_0269_0021_0000$$$::"What are you two talking about?"[lr]::
37886::$$$message_0269_0021_0001$$$::"What? You know, like how we want to eat crab tonight or stuff!"[lr]::
37887::$$$message_0269_0021_0002$$$::"No, I was just explaining to Shirou how to prepare for the date."[lr]::
37888::$$$message_0269_0021_0003$$$::"Nnn..."[lr]::
37889::$$$message_0269_0021_0004$$$::W-why are you always so straightforward, Rider...!?::
37890::$$$message_0269_0022_0000$$$::"A d-date!? We're just going to the pool!"[lr]::
37891::$$$message_0269_0022_0001$$$::"Yes, that would be called a date, Sakura.[lr]::
37892::$$$message_0269_0022_0002$$$::Fortunately, Shirou will give you his undivided attention, so please do not worry."[lr]::
37893::$$$message_0269_0022_0003$$$::"I didn't say[line len=2]wait, I did. So..."::
37894::$$$message_0269_0023_0000$$$::I'm going to the pool with Sakura.[lr]::
37895::$$$message_0269_0023_0001$$$::Then that will be a genuine date with Sakura, huh...[lr]::
37896::$$$message_0269_0023_0002$$$::I'm suddenly way too aware of how my face is heating up, and I think Sakura's the same.::
37897::$$$message_0269_0024_0000$$$::"Uh... S-Senpai... Please go easy on me."[lr]::
37898::$$$message_0269_0024_0001$$$::"...Yeah. So, you're fine with our plan for today?"::
37899::$$$message_0269_0025_0000$$$::"Yes. Oh, I'm going to get ready now, so can you please wait for a bit?"[lr]::
37900::$$$message_0269_0025_0001$$$::Of course, Sakura can't get ready in five minutes like me.::
37901::$$$message_0269_0026_0000$$$::"Well then, Sakura. I'll finish my usual chores."[lr]::
37902::$$$message_0269_0026_0001$$$::"Sorry Rider, [cacheimage storage=桜私服02c(遠)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服02c(遠) pos=r time=300 textoff=0]we're always going out having fun..."[lr]::
37903::$$$message_0269_0026_0002$$$::"There is no need to worry, please take your time. I will do something about lunch."::
37904::$$$message_0269_0027_0000$$$::Rider assuages apologetic Sakura like a big sister.[lr]::
37905::$$$message_0269_0027_0001$$$::So as to leave Sakura to get ready, Rider and I make our way out...::
37906::$$$message_0269_0028_0000$$$::"Sorry for the inconvenience."[lr]::
37907::$$$message_0269_0028_0001$$$::"No, that is my job."[lr]::
37908::$$$message_0269_0028_0002$$$::"...Thanks for saying so, anyway. I wish we could've gone together."[lr]::
37909::$$$message_0269_0028_0003$$$::"...Shirou, are you disappointed that you cannot go with me?[lr]::
37910::$$$message_0269_0028_0004$$$::I do not think that there is anything particularly enjoyable to look at, but[line len=2][cacheimage storage=ライダー私服04a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服04a(中) textoff=0]oh, Saber?"::
37911::$$$message_0269_0029_0000$$$::"What is wrong, Shirou?"[lr]::
37912::$$$message_0269_0029_0001$$$::"Saber. I'm going to go somewhere with Sakura[line len=2]"::
37913::$$$message_0269_0030_0000$$$::"Yes, Sakura and Shirou are going to spend time just by themselves, so we extras have to figure out what to do about lunch together."::
37914::$$$message_0269_0031_0000$$$::   [font italic=true]Huh?[font italic=false][lr]::
37915::$$$message_0269_0031_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中),ライダー私服01b(中) pos=l,r textoff=0]Rider hits us with that curve ball.[lr]::
37916::$$$message_0269_0031_0002$$$::We're both gobsmacked.::
37917::$$$message_0269_0032_0000$$$::"Wha... Rider, what do you mean by extras!?"[lr]::
37918::$$$message_0269_0032_0001$$$::"It's self-explanatory. Isn't it good for Servants, who are often neglected by their Masters, to occasionally warm each other up with friendship and intimacy?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
37919::$$$message_0269_0033_0000$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=ライダー私服01c(中) textoff=0][move time=400 path=(21,2,255)(36,11,255)(-56,2,255)(-43,12,255)(-131,2,255)(-113,13,255)(-211,2,255)(-193,13,255) storage=ライダー私服01c(中) accel=0 textoff=0][wait canskip=false time=70][move time=400 path=(236,71,255)(252,82,255)(151,71,255)(169,85,255)(74,71,255)(93,82,255)(-5,71,255)(5,82,255) storage=セイバー私服01c(中) accel=0 textoff=0]Rider pulls Saber's arm vigorously.[lr]::
37920::$$$message_0269_0033_0001$$$::...Is she trying to pull Saber away so that we won't be bothered...?[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
37921::$$$message_0269_0034_0000$$$::"What do you mean? Explain yourself, Rider!"[lr]::
37922::$$$message_0269_0034_0001$$$::"Do not say such insensitive things, Saber.[lr]::
37923::$$$message_0269_0034_0002$$$::Our sorrow will deepen, and from the pain of licking each other's wounds, love may begin to blossom."::
37924::$$$message_0269_0035_0000$$$::"That's as impossible as getting along with the King of Heroes.[lr]::
37925::$$$message_0269_0035_0001$$$::I beg your pardon, but while snakes and dragons share similarities, they are not the same."::
37926::$$$message_0269_0036_0000$$$::"You don't know that. They are both reptilian, and I believe that love can even form from such trivial misunderstandings.[lr]::
37927::$$$message_0269_0036_0001$$$::Well, for us, it will perhaps emerge at the end of a battle to the death."::
37928::$$$message_0269_0037_0000$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=240 top=2 time=1000 both=1 accel=-2 storage=ライダー私服01c(中) textoff=0][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0]Rider's getting carried away.[lr]::
37929::$$$message_0269_0037_0001$$$::Could it be that she's taking out her frustrations on Saber? For not being able to come with us?[wm canskip=0]::
37930::$$$message_0269_0038_0000$$$::"Shirou! Please say something to Rider!"[lr]::
37931::$$$message_0269_0038_0001$$$::"...Try to get along and don't break anything even if you fight. Discuss what to do about lunch between yourselves and get delivery or something."::
37932::$$$message_0269_0039_0000$$$::"Understood. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01c(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01c(中) textoff=0][move time=250 textoff=0 path=(150,2,255)(162,6,255)(35,2,255)(48,10,255)(-75,2,255)(-54,11,255)(-176,2,255)(-160,12,255)(-286,4,0) storage=ライダー私服01c(中) accel=0][wait canskip=false time=70][move time=250 textoff=0 path=(294,73,255)(309,86,255)(194,73,255)(207,85,255)(77,73,255)(94,86,255)(-26,73,255)(-18,81,255)(-122,73,255)(-106,81,255)(-267,73,0) storage=セイバー私服09b(中) accel=0]Then Saber, as kin of those with scales, why don't we spend the day locked in ardent, spine-tingling discomfort with one another? Heheheheheh."::
37933::$$$message_0269_0040_0000$$$::"Senpai? What happened to Rider?"[lr]::
37934::$$$message_0269_0040_0001$$$::Sakura must've snuck up on me while I was too busy parsing what was going on.::
37935::$$$message_0269_0041_0000$$$::"Oh, are you ready already? You were faster than I thought."[lr]::
37936::$$$message_0269_0041_0001$$$::"Yes, I figured this may happen, so I prepared ahead of time."::
37937::$$$message_0269_0042_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中) textoff=0]As expected. I suppose she was really looking forward to this.[lr]::
37938::$$$message_0269_0042_0001$$$::On the other hand, Sakura and I gaze towards the end of the hallway where Rider disappeared to.[lr]::
37939::$$$message_0269_0042_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服08a(中) textoff=0]We both seem to not be sure what to say about those two.::
37940::$$$message_0269_0043_0000$$$::"...I wonder if Rider felt lonely after all."[lr]::
37941::$$$message_0269_0043_0001$$$::"I think that's a little different.[lr]::
37942::$$$message_0269_0043_0002$$$::My guess is she was using it as the perfect excuse to bully Saber a bit."::
37943::$$$message_0269_0044_0000$$$::"...I hope so.[lr]::
37944::$$$message_0269_0044_0001$$$::I wonder if they're okay for lunch. Should I make them something?"[lr]::
37945::$$$message_0269_0044_0002$$$::"No, I think it's fine. I'm looking forward to hearing what they ate together later."::
37946::$$$message_0269_0045_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07b(中) textoff=0]I'm interested in what kind of lunch that incompatible pair would have.[lr]::
37947::$$$message_0269_0045_0001$$$::Neither of them cook, so going out to go eat somewhere is probably the most they can do.::
37948::$$$message_0269_0046_0000$$$::"All right, why don't get going?"[lr]::
37949::$$$message_0269_0046_0001$$$::"Yes, I'm excited, Senpai!"[lr]::
37950::$$$message_0269_0046_0002$$$::"We're heading out... Hey, we'll be back by the evening."[lr]::
37951::$$$message_0269_0046_0003$$$::I call out to them, but I wonder if they can hear me. It bothers me that there's no response.::
37952::$$$message_0269_0047_0000$$$::"I-I'm a bit worried. Should we go see how those two are doing one last time?"[lr]::
37953::$$$message_0269_0047_0001$$$::"I mean... They're probably doing well."::
37954::$$$message_0269_0048_0000$$$::We arrive in Shinto.[lr]::
37955::$$$message_0269_0048_0001$$$::If we walk ten more minutes, we'll arrive at Waku Waku Zabuun.::
37956::$$$message_0269_0049_0000$$$::"We should've come more often if it's so close."[lr]::
37957::$$$message_0269_0049_0001$$$::"Yeah... But, how do I put it?"::
37958::$$$message_0269_0050_0000$$$::I don't feel like I can be entirely happy about it.[lr]::
37959::$$$message_0269_0050_0001$$$::Is it even profitable to make such a place in an isolated town like this? I feel like there's a lot going on behind-the-scenes I'd love to know.[lr]::
37960::$$$message_0269_0050_0002$$$::I think it'd be too much for some rich company's hobby, but if that is the case, then I would offer my condolences.[lr]::
37961::$$$message_0269_0050_0003$$$::Well, their naming sense is great.::
37962::$$$message_0269_0051_0000$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
37963::$$$message_0269_0051_0001$$$::"Huh? Ah, well, you'll see why they say 'seeing is believing.'"[lr]::
37964::$$$message_0269_0051_0002$$$::...But, I'm sure Sakura in a swimsuit would be the same.[lr]::
37965::$$$message_0269_0051_0003$$$::Even Rider sang her praises. That destructive power must be as overwhelming as you'd expect[line len=2]::
37966::$$$message_0269_0052_0000$$$::"Oh? Senpai, it's not over here?"[lr]::
37967::$$$message_0269_0052_0001$$$::"...Yeah, sorry, I was spacing out."[lr]::
37968::$$$message_0269_0052_0002$$$::"Hm...?"::
37969::$$$message_0269_0053_0000$$$::I almost take the wrong path.[lr]::
37970::$$$message_0269_0053_0001$$$::...How pathetic. What am I getting this embarrassed for? We're just on a date...in swimsuits.[lr]::
37971::$$$message_0269_0053_0002$$$::We're living together all the time, and standing at the kitchen together for over two years! It's just like taking a bath together[line len=2]a bath!?[lr]::
37972::$$$message_0269_0053_0003$$$::"Gah..."[lr]::
37973::$$$message_0269_0053_0004$$$::I really dug my own hole with that.::
37974::$$$message_0269_0054_0000$$$::"Senpai, you'll be going back that way."[lr]::
37975::$$$message_0269_0054_0001$$$::"...I know. This way, right? This way."[lr]::
37976::$$$message_0269_0054_0002$$$::"Are you worried about Saber after all?"[lr]::
37977::$$$message_0269_0054_0003$$$::That's not it, Sakura... Ugh, it's frustrating, but it's not like I can say the reason to her face...::
37978::$$$message_0269_0055_0000$$$::"Oh, we can see it now. Senpai, do you have our tickets?"[lr]::
37979::$$$message_0269_0055_0001$$$::"Yup, I remembered. I don't think I'd ever live it down if I forgot.[lr]::
37980::$$$message_0269_0055_0002$$$::...All right. The changing rooms are separate, so we'll meet inside." [lr]::
37981::$$$message_0269_0055_0003$$$::"Okay then, see you inside."::
37982::$$$message_0269_0056_0000$$$::...Now.[lr]::
37983::$$$message_0269_0056_0001$$$::Even if I change and come out to the pool, I'll still feel like I'm daydreaming.[lr]::
37984::$$$message_0269_0056_0002$$$::For one simple reason: Sakura in a swimsuit.[lr]::
37985::$$$message_0269_0056_0003$$$::...For example, I can somewhat imagine that Saber would be slim and beautiful.[lr]::
37986::$$$message_0269_0056_0004$$$::I don't know how Sakura would turn out.[lr]::
37987::$$$message_0269_0056_0005$$$::It's a decisive battle where hidden deadly weapons come into play, and the solution is sought in the dark.::
37988::$$$message_0269_0057_0000$$$::"...It's like a Noble Phantasm."[lr]::
37989::$$$message_0269_0057_0001$$$::A disturbing analogy comes out.[lr]::
37990::$$$message_0269_0057_0002$$$::If Rider was also here, there's no doubt that my very being would decompose like a microorganism being sterilized by the pool's chlorine.::
37991::$$$message_0269_0058_0000$$$::...I mean, think about it.[lr]::
37992::$$$message_0269_0058_0001$$$::Like...her chest...and her butt...[lr]::
37993::$$$message_0269_0058_0002$$$::And Sakura's waist is really small...::
37994::$$$message_0269_0059_0000$$$::"Wait. Calm down, just calm down."[lr]::
37995::$$$message_0269_0059_0001$$$::Take it easy. Composure is the arena ticket to success.[lr]::
37996::$$$message_0269_0059_0002$$$::I sit on the floor holding my knees by the poolside.[lr]::
37997::$$$message_0269_0059_0003$$$::It's utterly pathetic, but it's tough if I'm not in this position.[lr]::
37998::$$$message_0269_0059_0004$$$::I take a deep breath, concentrate, and calm myself down. I will be calm when I see Sakura[line len=2]::
37999::$$$message_0269_0060_0000$$$::"Thank you for waiting!"[lr]::
38000::$$$message_0269_0060_0001$$$::I hear an excited voice.[lr]::
38001::$$$message_0269_0060_0002$$$::Come on, the Noble Phantasm won't be as threatening once I find out its identity. Instead of weird assumptions, the real thing might actually be[line len=2]::
38002::$$$message_0269_0061_0000$$$::"Wow, they actually made an indoor pool like this!"[lr]::
38003::$$$message_0269_0061_0001$$$::...Yeah, what was that, again?::
38004::$$$message_0269_0062_0000$$$::"Look Senpai, they even have that sort of water slide. I was imagining something more like a fifty-meter indoor pool."::
38005::$$$message_0269_0063_0000$$$::"...Senpai? What's wrong?"::
38006::$$$message_0269_0064_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38007::$$$message_0269_0064_0001$$$::My brain has finally gotten used to the stimulant.[lr]::
38008::$$$message_0269_0064_0002$$$::Sakura's swimsuit is a bikini, and there's quite a lot of skin showing.[lr]::
38009::$$$message_0269_0064_0003$$$::The cloth that only just hides her pale clear skin and busty body is nearly nonexistent. [lr]::
38010::$$$message_0269_0064_0004$$$::To the degree that[line len=2]::
38011::$$$message_0269_0065_0000$$$::"How is it? Does it look good on me, Senpai?"[lr]::
38012::$$$message_0269_0065_0001$$$::"...Oh, well, um..."::
38013::$$$message_0269_0066_0000$$$::"I thought it was a bit bold, but since Saber and Rider also had two-piece swimsuits, I worked up my courage!"[lr]::
38014::$$$message_0269_0066_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊02b(中) textoff=0]Oh... I see.[lr]::
38015::$$$message_0269_0066_0002$$$::Thanks to that courage, I'm still dizzy.::
38016::$$$message_0269_0067_0000$$$::"L-[wvl canskip=0 time=300]looks good on you, [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊02b(中),o新都_室内プール-(昼)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][clfg][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=桜fd特殊02b(中)][fg left=0 index=1000 top=0 storage=o新都_室内プール-(昼)][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=391 imag=2.5 time=100 cy=252 mag=2.5 my=0 rot=-0.0 accel=0][transex textoff=0 time=200]I mean...[cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊02b(中),o新都_室内プール-(昼)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][clfg][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=桜fd特殊02b(中)][fg left=0 index=1000 top=0 storage=o新都_室内プール-(昼)][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=470 imag=2.9 time=100 cy=626 mag=2.9 my=0 rot=-0.0 accel=0][transex textoff=0 time=200]yeah."[lr]::
38017::$$$message_0269_0067_0001$$$::Yes, very smooth. I know words.[lr]::
38018::$$$message_0269_0067_0002$$$::No matter how many times I look at Sakura, it's... Y-yeah, no.::
38019::$$$message_0269_0068_0000$$$::"...Senpai? Do I look weird?"[lr]::
38020::$$$message_0269_0068_0001$$$::"No, nothing like that. I'm the weird one, here."::
38021::$$$message_0269_0069_0000$$$::I can't help but stare at how smooth her cleavage and collarbones look. Hormones are taking over.[lr]::
38022::$$$message_0269_0069_0001$$$::We finally made it to the pool, and yet here I am, in this state... How embarrassing.::
38023::$$$message_0269_0070_0000$$$::"...Senpai?"[lr]::
38024::$$$message_0269_0070_0001$$$::Sakura grabs my hand.[lr]::
38025::$$$message_0269_0070_0002$$$::She forces me to look directly at her.::
38026::$$$message_0269_0071_0000$$$::"Please look at me. Um... [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊01c頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊01c頬(近) textoff=0]I-it would make me more embarrassed if you don't."[lr]::
38027::$$$message_0269_0071_0001$$$::Sakura blushes.[lr]::
38028::$$$message_0269_0071_0002$$$::That's true, if I'm embarrassed, even Sakura would get embarrassed.[lr]::
38029::$$$message_0269_0071_0003$$$::My role as a companion in times like these, is to get it together.::
38030::$$$message_0269_0072_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38031::$$$message_0269_0072_0001$$$::Fully mobilizing my intellect and rationality, I calm myself down.[lr]::
38032::$$$message_0269_0072_0002$$$::...First and foremost, I give my honest impression.::
38033::$$$message_0269_0073_0000$$$::"Sorry, my heart is beating real fast right now.[lr]::
38034::$$$message_0269_0073_0001$$$::...You look super cute, Sakura."[lr]::
38035::$$$message_0269_0073_0002$$$::"Really? [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊02b頬(中)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=200 storage=桜fd特殊02b頬(中) textoff=0]You're not just saying that?"[lr]::
38036::$$$message_0269_0073_0003$$$::"...That's stupid. If I were flattering you, I'd heap even more on."::
38037::$$$message_0269_0074_0000$$$::"Yay, it was worth working up the courage to wear this swimsuit! [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊02b頬(近)][wvl][shock vmax=30 time=400 count=-3][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊02b頬(近) pos=c textoff=0]I'm glad, Senpai."[wvs][se storage=se042.wav]::
38038::$$$message_0269_0075_0000$$$::"Hnng!?"[lr]::
38039::$$$message_0269_0075_0001$$$::Sakura throws her arms around me.[lr]::
38040::$$$message_0269_0075_0002$$$::L-looking is fine now, but I'm not ready for this...!::
38041::$$$message_0269_0076_0000$$$::"A-anyway, let's go swim!"[lr]::
38042::$$$message_0269_0076_0001$$$::I can cool my head if we go for a dip.[lr]::
38043::$$$message_0269_0076_0002$$$::If I continue touching Sakura skin-to-skin like this, my body and nerves will definitely overheat.::
38044::$$$message_0269_0077_0000$$$::"Yes, we did come to swim after all."::
38045::$$$message_0269_0078_0000$$$::Sakura hurries towards the water, still clinging onto me.[lr]::
38046::$$$message_0269_0078_0001$$$::I'm curious how the others are seeing us, but more than that, I gotta get to the water already...!::
38047::$$$message_0269_0079_0000$$$::It's already October, but it's almost like summer inside this dome.[lr]::
38048::$$$message_0269_0079_0001$$$::There are no midsummer rays of sun to bear down oppressively on us.[lr]::
38049::$$$message_0269_0079_0002$$$::But it still feels absolutely like summer when in the pool.::
38050::$$$message_0269_0080_0000$$$::"Woah... Hey, [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊02b(中)][wvl][se storage=se551.wav][wm canskip=0][haze_back][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊02b(中) textoff=0 last=桜fd特殊01e(中)][move textoff=0 time=400 path=(305,127,255)(311,143,255)(321,134,255) storage=桜fd特殊02b(中) accel=-2 spline=1]wait up, Senpai!"[lr]::
38051::$$$message_0269_0080_0001$$$::Sakura swims over unsteadily.[lr]::
38052::$$$message_0269_0080_0002$$$::She's not completely hopeless at swimming, but her form is not quite there.[wm canskip=0]::
38053::$$$message_0269_0081_0000$$$::Though I'd say that's par of the course with her. I'm not surprised she's not used to this.[wm canskip=0][haze_back][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊01f(中) textoff=0 last=桜fd特殊01e(中)]::
38054::$$$message_0269_0082_0000$$$::"You okay? It's not a competition or anything, so there's no need to panic. Besides, your feet can touch the ground here."[haze_back][lr]::
38055::$$$message_0269_0082_0001$$$::"Oh... [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊02a(中)][wvl][haze_back][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊02a(中) textoff=0 last=桜fd特殊01e(中)][move textoff=0 time=300 path=(305,188,255)(295,195,255)(291,187,255)(301,180,255) storage=桜fd特殊02a(中) accel=-2 spline=1]Yes, I'll try my best!"::
38056::$$$message_0269_0083_0000$$$::Then she approaches, swimming as if she's doing a front crawl...I think.[lr]::
38057::$$$message_0269_0083_0001$$$::Hmm... Will this just turn into a swimming lesson?[wm canskip=0]::
38058::$$$message_0269_0084_0000$$$::"Ah, I finally caught up.[lr]::
38059::$$$message_0269_0084_0001$$$::Senpai, you're fast at swimming since you work out."[lr]::
38060::$$$message_0269_0084_0002$$$::"No, I think I'm average if I time myself. Besides, there's no swimming in my daily routine."[lr]::
38061::$$$message_0269_0084_0003$$$::"Really? I can barely swim twenty-five meters in freestyle."::
38062::$$$message_0269_0085_0000$$$::Yeah, it must be hard swimming like that.[lr]::
38063::$$$message_0269_0085_0001$$$::Sakura's way of swimming is overly nervous, and it looks as though it would be easier to fix if she just started by relaxing and getting comfortable floating.::
38064::$$$message_0269_0086_0000$$$::"Sakura, are you not very good at swimming?"[lr]::
38065::$$$message_0269_0086_0001$$$::"I'm not athletic overall, ahaha... [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊01b(近)][wvl][haze_back][chgfg storage=桜fd特殊01b(近) time=400 textoff=0]Oh, but kyudo is the only thing that comes naturally to me."::
38066::$$$message_0269_0087_0000$$$::That's the incredible thing about Sakura.[lr]::
38067::$$$message_0269_0087_0001$$$::[haze_back][chgfg time=200 storage=桜fd特殊01e(近) textoff=0][move textoff=0 opacity=255 storage=桜fd特殊01e(近) cx=217 py=395 px=395 affine=(387,390,-4,1,255,217,276)(361,412,-16,1,255,217,276)(349,399,0,1,255,217,276)(366,395,-4,1,255,217,276)(396,406,0,1,255,217,276)(385,387,0,1,255,217,276) time=1500 cy=276 mag=1 deg=0 accel=-2 spline=1][se storage=se551.wav]She became captain not only because of her popularity and nurturing side, but because she has talent.[lr]::
38068::$$$message_0269_0087_0002$$$::The bow must be something that you don't just pull using power.[wm canskip=0][haze_back][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊01f(近) textoff=0]::
38069::$$$message_0269_0088_0000$$$::"But you're athletic. I'm jealous."[lr]::
38070::$$$message_0269_0088_0001$$$::"Thanks. But you know, as they say, a jack-of-all-trades is a master of none. It would be good if I had one thing I was particularly good at."::
38071::$$$message_0269_0089_0000$$$::I can only barely say I'm good with the bow and arrow.[lr]::
38072::$$$message_0269_0089_0001$$$::It might not be bad to try going back into kyudo again once I've set my mind to it.[lr]::
38073::$$$message_0269_0089_0002$$$::Wait, now's not the time to think about kyudo. We're at the pool.::
38074::$$$message_0269_0090_0000$$$::"Sakura, what kind of swimming can you do?"[lr]::
38075::$$$message_0269_0090_0001$$$::"Umm, I'm not good at the backstroke."[lr]::
38076::$$$message_0269_0090_0002$$$::"...That is quite something."[lr]::
38077::$$$message_0269_0090_0003$$$::"What?"[lr]::
38078::$$$message_0269_0090_0004$$$::"Oh, no, nothing."[lr]::
38079::$$$message_0269_0090_0005$$$::My mind went there almost immediately.[lr]::
38080::$$$message_0269_0090_0006$$$::A backstroke with that chest... Her boobs wouldn't float up and actually cause drag or resistance, right?[lr]::
38081::$$$message_0269_0090_0007$$$::Right. [wait canskip=false time=400]Surely. [wait canskip=false time=600]Probably.::
38082::$$$message_0269_0091_0000$$$::"I can't do the butterfly stroke and I can barely manage the breaststroke. I'm even slower at freestyle."[lr]::
38083::$$$message_0269_0091_0001$$$::"It's usually the other way around... I see, that's like you, Sakura."[lr]::
38084::$$$message_0269_0091_0002$$$::"Oh, but I have something that I'm good at!"[lr]::
38085::$$$message_0269_0091_0003$$$::Sakura gets excited as if she remembered something.::
38086::$$$message_0269_0092_0000$$$::"Huh. Is it like high diving or maybe being a goalie in water polo?"[lr]::
38087::$$$message_0269_0092_0001$$$::I think of things that don't have much to do with swimming.[lr]::
38088::$$$message_0269_0092_0002$$$::Sakura shakes her finger...[lr]::
38089::$$$message_0269_0092_0003$$$::"Diving!"[lr]::
38090::$$$message_0269_0092_0004$$$::...and makes her proud declaration.::
38091::$$$message_0269_0093_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
38092::$$$message_0269_0093_0001$$$::My eyes go wide.[lr]::
38093::$$$message_0269_0093_0002$$$::Diving, as in freediving?::
38094::$$$message_0269_0094_0000$$$::"Um, you see. It was a secret, but I'm pretty confident about holding my breath underwater!"[lr]::
38095::$$$message_0269_0094_0001$$$::"Oh, okay..."::
38096::$$$message_0269_0095_0000$$$::That's a rather plain, disappointing answer.[lr]::
38097::$$$message_0269_0095_0001$$$::I wonder how long she can hold her breath. Sakura is patient, so maybe a while.[lr]::
38098::$$$message_0269_0095_0002$$$::...All right.[lr]::
38099::$$$message_0269_0095_0003$$$::I'll make Sakura look good here.::
38100::$$$message_0269_0096_0000$$$::"Do you want to compete then? At staying underwater."[lr]::
38101::$$$message_0269_0096_0001$$$::"Huh? A competition with you, Senpai!?"[lr]::
38102::$$$message_0269_0096_0002$$$::"Yeah. We'll dive on the count of three, and the one who goes up first loses. The loser will treat the winner to lunch."[lr]::
38103::$$$message_0269_0096_0003$$$::"Huh, whattt? Whatttt!?"[wm canskip=0]::
38104::$$$message_0269_0097_0000$$$::She's panicking.[lr]::
38105::$$$message_0269_0097_0001$$$::Even though I'm not good at this sort of thing, this might be a good battle with Sakura.::
38106::$$$message_0269_0098_0000$$$::"All right. Counting down from five, four..."[lr]::
38107::$$$message_0269_0098_0001$$$::"Okay then, yes please, Senpai!"[lr]::
38108::$$$message_0269_0098_0002$$$::"That's the spirit, Captain Matou![lr]::
38109::$$$message_0269_0098_0003$$$::Then, three, two, one... GO!"::
38110::$$$message_0269_0099_0000$$$::I fill my lungs with as much air as I can and dive underwater.[lr]::
38111::$$$message_0269_0099_0001$$$::We're underwater.[lr]::
38112::$$$message_0269_0099_0002$$$::I sink so that my body doesn't float.[lr]::
38113::$$$message_0269_0099_0003$$$::Sakura said she's confident in her freediving, but I wonder how much it is... I didn't ask her underwater record.[wsplinemove canskip=0]::
38114::$$$message_0269_0100_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38115::$$$message_0269_0100_0001$$$::I don't have the composure to think anymore.[lr]::
38116::$$$message_0269_0100_0002$$$::Even if I fill my lungs up with a lot of air, it doesn't mean I can use it as oxygen effectively.[lr]::
38117::$$$message_0269_0100_0003$$$::In fact, it's harder to breathe when my lungs don't move.[lr]::
38118::$$$message_0269_0100_0004$$$::Precious air escapes my mouth little by little.::
38119::$$$message_0269_0101_0000$$$::...I wonder how Sakura is doing.[lr]::
38120::$$$message_0269_0101_0001$$$::Oh, there she is. She looks pretty calm.::
38121::$$$message_0269_0102_0000$$$::...I can't hear well.[lr]::
38122::$$$message_0269_0102_0001$$$::A foreign soundscape, cut off from the buzz of the pool.[lr]::
38123::$$$message_0269_0102_0002$$$::I can't hear any noisy voices, but I can hear the sounds of fluttering kicks from close by.::
38124::$$$message_0269_0103_0000$$$::There's the sensation of water pressure that envelopes my skin.[lr]::
38125::$$$message_0269_0103_0001$$$::I wonder how much time has passed.[lr]::
38126::$$$message_0269_0103_0002$$$::I let out air little by little, without taking in any.[lr]::
38127::$$$message_0269_0103_0003$$$::The moment I let out air, it gets easier and I feel a sense of relief, but the need for oxygen slowly closes in around me with each exhale.::
38128::$$$message_0269_0104_0000$$$::"......[line len=3]"[lr]::
38129::$$$message_0269_0104_0001$$$::...It's starting to seriously get tough.[lr]::
38130::$$$message_0269_0104_0002$$$::...I can hold out a bit longer.[lr]::
38131::$$$message_0269_0104_0003$$$::...If it's Sakura's area of expertise, then I want to give my all in opposing her. That sheer determination pushes my lungs to their limits[line len=2]::
38132::$$$message_0269_0105_0000$$$::Sakura... Wow, her expression doesn't change at all.[lr]::
38133::$$$message_0269_0105_0001$$$::Even when underwater, she's the same as when she's on land. [se storage=se553.wav volume=70]I make eye contact with her, but I don't have the composure to make her laugh.[lr]::
38134::$$$message_0269_0105_0002$$$::On the other hand, Sakura is looking over here mischievously.::
38135::$$$message_0269_0106_0000$$$::".........[line len=3]"[lr]::
38136::$$$message_0269_0106_0001$$$::...It's starting to get real tough at last.[lr]::
38137::$$$message_0269_0106_0002$$$::...I regret the air that I let out and want to take back the oxygen bubbles that are floating away.[lr]::
38138::$$$message_0269_0106_0003$$$::...I don't have enough air. I'm tempted to breathe in water.[lr]::
38139::$$$message_0269_0106_0004$$$::...Sakura is looking over here in delight.::
38140::$$$message_0269_0107_0000$$$::...I can't go up first.[lr]::
38141::$$$message_0269_0107_0001$$$::...If Sakura is pleased over such a simple game like this, then I need to stay with her a few seconds longer.[lr]::
38142::$$$message_0269_0107_0002$$$::"...[line len=3]"[lr]::
38143::$$$message_0269_0107_0003$$$::...Damn it, I can't take it anymore... I'm going to suffocate.[lr]::
38144::$$$message_0269_0107_0004$$$::...But just a bit more; I have to keep Sakura company for at least ten more seconds[line len=2]::
38145::$$$message_0269_0108_0000$$$::"...Senpai."[lr]::
38146::$$$message_0269_0108_0001$$$::A sound underwater [se storage=se554.wav]that I shouldn't be able to hear. [sestop storage=se554.wav time=500 nowait=true][lr]::
38147::$$$message_0269_0108_0002$$$::Sakura moves to swim closer to me.[lr]::
38148::$$$message_0269_0108_0003$$$::She should be bad at swimming, but her movements are as smooth as a mermaid's.[wm canskip=0]::
38149::$$$message_0269_0109_0000$$$::A warm hand touches my cheek.[lr]::
38150::$$$message_0269_0109_0001$$$::Lips cover mine.[lr]::
38151::$$$message_0269_0109_0002$$$::Air passes into my lungs despite this world of water.::
38152::$$$message_0269_0110_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38153::$$$message_0269_0110_0001$$$::It was warm. A gift that I wanted to savor.[lr]::
38154::$$$message_0269_0110_0002$$$::My lungs devour the air provided to me, the relief of breathing in more oxygen is even more vivid and intense than the softness of her lips.::
38155::$$$message_0269_0111_0000$$$::Sakura smiles underwater.[lr]::
38156::$$$message_0269_0111_0001$$$::She surfaces before I do...::
38157::$$$message_0269_0112_0000$$$::"..."[wvs][sestop storage=se553.wav time=900 nowait=true][lr]::
38158::$$$message_0269_0112_0001$$$::I can't process what just happened.[lr]::
38159::$$$message_0269_0112_0002$$$::Sakura's surprising act.[lr]::
38160::$$$message_0269_0112_0003$$$::Sakura's intention to help me even though it's a match.[lr]::
38161::$$$message_0269_0112_0004$$$::Sakura's soft lips, and the breath that filled my lungs like fire.::
38162::$$$message_0269_0113_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38163::$$$message_0269_0113_0001$$$::I felt like I was being called.[lr]::
38164::$$$message_0269_0113_0002$$$::That's right, Sakura is above the water. There's no need to stay longer.[lr]::
38165::$$$message_0269_0113_0003$$$::I kick to return to the surface of the water, my mind still fuzzy.::
38166::$$$message_0269_0114_0000$$$::"Ah... I lost, Senpai."[lr]::
38167::$$$message_0269_0114_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
38168::$$$message_0269_0114_0002$$$::I take a deep breath and savor the fresh air.[lr]::
38169::$$$message_0269_0114_0003$$$::Sakura already has her breathing under control.::
38170::$$$message_0269_0115_0000$$$::"...Fuu... Fuu, fuu...[lr]::
38171::$$$message_0269_0115_0001$$$::No, I'm the one who lost."[lr]::
38172::$$$message_0269_0115_0002$$$::"But the rule was whoever surfaced first lost."[lr]::
38173::$$$message_0269_0115_0003$$$::"Haah... It's unfair, I lasted longer than I should have. Sakura, you gave me air... But, uh, why did you do that?"[lr]::
38174::$$$message_0269_0115_0004$$$::"..."::
38175::$$$message_0269_0116_0000$$$::It was a question that I'm not supposed to ask.[lr]::
38176::$$$message_0269_0116_0001$$$::A question so tough that, if I were forced to figure out the answer myself, I'd have to dive back down and contemplate it at the bottom of the pool for a while.::
38177::$$$message_0269_0117_0000$$$::"...Um, Senpai... Are you mad?"[lr]::
38178::$$$message_0269_0117_0001$$$::"I'm not mad. To be honest, it helped and it made me happy.[lr]::
38179::$$$message_0269_0117_0002$$$::But, that's why I'm curious. Why did you do such a thing, Sakura?"::
38180::$$$message_0269_0118_0000$$$::"...Uh. Since you seemed to be suffering."[lr]::
38181::$$$message_0269_0118_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
38182::$$$message_0269_0118_0002$$$::"...I'm sorry. It was really on a whim.[lr]::
38183::$$$message_0269_0118_0003$$$::Seeing you endure it made me think I have to help you, and I couldn't help it... [cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊01c頬(中)][wvl][haze_back][chgfg time=300 storage=桜fd特殊01c頬(中) textoff=0]I'm sorry."::
38184::$$$message_0269_0119_0000$$$::Sakura apologizes.[lr]::
38185::$$$message_0269_0119_0001$$$::In other words, Sakura forgot about the match and did that because she wanted to help me.::
38186::$$$message_0269_0120_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
38187::$$$message_0269_0120_0001$$$::There's no way I wouldn't be happy.[lr]::
38188::$$$message_0269_0120_0002$$$::Sakura must've also remembered as well, as she blushes and starts to panic.[lr]::
38189::$$$message_0269_0120_0003$$$::Kissing underwater is so embarrassing I don't even know what to do anymore.::
38190::$$$message_0269_0121_0000$$$::"B-but I lost, so I'll go buy lunch!"[lr]::
38191::$$$message_0269_0121_0001$$$::"No, I lost from disqualification, so I'll treat you!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
38192::$$$message_0269_0121_0002$$$::"But even if you'd cheated, no one was watching, so I wouldn't protest!"[cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊01d(遠)][wvs][haze_back][se storage=se552.wav][se storage=se608.wav][fg opacity=0 opacity=0 left=-83 index=400 top=268 time=100 storage=セイバーfd特殊01d(遠) textoff=0][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(-41,240,150)(-19,225,200)(-14,210,255)(-16,198,255)(-35,203,255)(-35,190,255) storage=セイバーfd特殊01d(遠) accel=-2 spline=1]::
38193::$$$message_0269_0121_0003$$$::"Yes, Sakura lost because she went up first..."[wm canskip=0]::
38194::$$$message_0269_0122_0000$$$::...?[lr]::
38195::$$$message_0269_0122_0001$$$::"Oh, while I had taken my eyes off of her[line len=2]I'm terribly sorry."[lr]::
38196::$$$message_0269_0122_0002$$$::What...was that?::
38197::$$$message_0269_0123_0000$$$::"...Sakura. Was that...?"[lr]::
38198::$$$message_0269_0123_0001$$$::"Huh? W-[cacheimage storage=桜fd特殊01f(中)][wvl][haze_back][chgfg time=200 storage=桜fd特殊01f(中) textoff=0]was that just a doppelganger?[lr]::
38199::$$$message_0269_0123_0002$$$::Let's do this for lunch.[lr]::
38200::$$$message_0269_0123_0003$$$::Please go get the drinks. I'll buy our lunch."[lr]::
38201::$$$message_0269_0123_0004$$$::"So it doesn't count, or more like a draw. Got it."::
38202::$$$message_0269_0124_0000$$$::If anything, the results are more disadvantageous for Sakura.[lr]::
38203::$$$message_0269_0124_0001$$$::But if we were to do a rematch, I have a feeling that I would seriously be done for if she kissed me underwater again. [lr]::
38204::$$$message_0269_0124_0002$$$::I feel like Sakura's breath is still in the back of my throat.[lr]::
38205::$$$message_0269_0124_0003$$$::When I press my finger to my lips, it feels as if it's warmly melting.::
38206::$$$message_0269_0125_0000$$$::"...Senpai, do you have any preferences for lunch?"[lr]::
38207::$$$message_0269_0125_0001$$$::Sakura asks, and my gaze goes back to her.[lr]::
38208::$$$message_0269_0125_0002$$$::The inside of my mind is still fuzzy from the aftertaste of the kiss, but I try to clear it from my thoughts.::
38209::$$$message_0269_0126_0000$$$::"Hm. If we're thinking of the beach or the pool, then it's gotta be yakisoba."[lr]::
38210::$$$message_0269_0126_0001$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
38211::$$$message_0269_0126_0002$$$::"Well, yakisoba is generally more of a beach shack or festival stand thing. I guess I have high expectations of the food stalls here."::
38212::$$$message_0269_0127_0000$$$::"True, yakisoba would be out of place at a fancy restaurant. Strangely enough, it's perfectly fine when served at a Chinese restaurant..."::
38213::$$$message_0269_0128_0000$$$::Somehow we start talking about food.[lr]::
38214::$$$message_0269_0128_0001$$$::Now, I'm still dizzy from what just happened, but we should take a break, eat some lunch, and then swim again.::
38215::$$$message_0269_0129_0000$$$::"Once we finish eating lunch, let's go on the water slide this time, Senpai."[lr]::
38216::$$$message_0269_0129_0001$$$::"Good idea. All right, let's not stop until we drop."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
38217::$$$message_0269_0129_0002$$$::"Yes, let's eat a lot so we have all the energy needed for later!"::
38218::$$$message_0269_0130_0000$$$::We still haven't had enough fun.[lr]::
38219::$$$message_0269_0130_0001$$$::It's a rare opportunity to hang out with Sakura, so we should have fun to our heart's content...::
38220::$$$message_0269_0131_0000$$$::"Haah, my shoulders feel heavy, Senpai."[lr]::
38221::$$$message_0269_0131_0001$$$::"Yeah, you use muscles at the pool that you don't otherwise, ugh..."::
38222::$$$message_0269_0132_0000$$$::We end up swimming as much as we can until the afternoon.[lr]::
38223::$$$message_0269_0132_0001$$$::A trip down the water slide, wrestling with the wave pool; we even work on Sakura's swimming technique for a while.[lr]::
38224::$$$message_0269_0132_0002$$$::We swam so much that our fingers have become pruney and wrinkly.[lr]::
38225::$$$message_0269_0132_0003$$$::Without either of us mentioning it, we decide to head home before the sun sets...::
38226::$$$message_0269_0133_0000$$$::"If we go to the pool regularly, we would probably be able to build strength."[lr]::
38227::$$$message_0269_0133_0001$$$::"I think an athletic club kind of thing would be better in that case...but..."[lr]::
38228::$$$message_0269_0133_0002$$$::It felt like an entire summer's worth of fun at Waku Waku Zabuun with Sakura.[lr]::
38229::$$$message_0269_0133_0003$$$::Even now, that underwater kiss is carved into my memory.::
38230::$$$message_0269_0134_0000$$$::...After that, I didn't panic as much when I saw Sakura in a swimsuit.[lr]::
38231::$$$message_0269_0134_0001$$$::It's nothing compared to what just happened.[lr]::
38232::$$$message_0269_0134_0002$$$::...If I think about it like that, that kiss was like a good luck charm.::
38233::$$$message_0269_0135_0000$$$::"That pool would be more tropical and fun if we went in the summer, wouldn't it?"[lr]::
38234::$$$message_0269_0135_0001$$$::"It was ridiculously summer-like even in October there, though... I wonder what it would be like at the height of summer."[lr]::
38235::$$$message_0269_0135_0002$$$::I wonder if it would be more like a tropical Hawaiian mood. But, there should be other options if it was in the middle of summer.::
38236::$$$message_0269_0136_0000$$$::"I want to go to the beach once it's summer next year."[lr]::
38237::$$$message_0269_0136_0001$$$::"That would be nice, the actual beach would be more spacious. There are also swimming areas and beach shacks."[lr]::
38238::$$$message_0269_0136_0002$$$::"Or like watermelon splitting on the sand."[lr]::
38239::$$$message_0269_0136_0003$$$::"I bet Saber and Rider would be serious about it."[lr]::
38240::$$$message_0269_0136_0004$$$::"Fuji-nee would be serious if she had a bamboo sword in her hand too."::
38241::$$$message_0269_0137_0000$$$::I imagine a strangely heated watermelon splitting match on the sand.[lr]::
38242::$$$message_0269_0137_0001$$$::The match probably wouldn't be settled even if you prepared a dozen of them.[lr]::
38243::$$$message_0269_0137_0002$$$::We must've imagined the same thing, as we both laugh.::
38244::$$$message_0269_0138_0000$$$::"...It would be nice if Rin, Illya and Mitsuzuri-senpai join as well."[lr]::
38245::$$$message_0269_0138_0001$$$::"That's nice too, but I also feel like I want to go to the beach with just the two of us."[lr]::
38246::$$$message_0269_0138_0002$$$::If we do that, I can spend time with Sakura again.[lr]::
38247::$$$message_0269_0138_0003$$$::Even if it's the evening beach, if we're looking at the same sunset together[line len=2]::
38248::$$$message_0269_0139_0000$$$::"Senpai."[lr]::
38249::$$$message_0269_0139_0001$$$::Sakura intertwines her fingers in mine.[lr]::
38250::$$$message_0269_0139_0002$$$::After coming out of the pool, our hands seem to meld together.[lr]::
38251::$$$message_0269_0139_0003$$$::I can feel her heartbeat through the palm of my hand, racing.::
38252::$$$message_0269_0140_0000$$$::"Oh, look, an evening star!"[lr]::
38253::$$$message_0269_0140_0001$$$::Sakura points to the western sky.[lr]::
38254::$$$message_0269_0140_0002$$$::The light that shines in the crimson-hued sky is...[lr]::
38255::$$$message_0269_0140_0003$$$::"Is that Venus?"::
38256::$$$message_0269_0141_0000$$$::"Yes, I'm looking forward to looking for the evening stars with you at the beach. [cacheimage storage=桜私服07e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服07e(中) time=300 textoff=0]We should definitely go."[lr]::
38257::$$$message_0269_0141_0001$$$::I nod to Sakura.[lr]::
38258::$$$message_0269_0141_0002$$$::There's no reason to decline. That's what I'm hoping for too.::
38259::$$$message_0269_0142_0000$$$::"C'mon. Saber and Rider are waiting too."[lr]::
38260::$$$message_0269_0142_0001$$$::"Oh, we need to prepare dinner... [cacheimage storage=桜私服02e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服02e(中) time=300 textoff=0]I wonder if they had lunch."[lr]::
38261::$$$message_0269_0142_0002$$$::"...I feel like they were eating yakisoba and frankfurters. Well, we'll ask them about it later."::
38262::$$$message_0269_0143_0000$$$::We head home.[lr]::
38263::$$$message_0269_0143_0001$$$::I've been holding hands with Sakura the whole time.::
38264::$$$message_0269_0144_0000$$$::"We're home."[lr]::
38265::$$$message_0269_0144_0001$$$::"Yes, we are home."::
938153::$$$message_9269_0110_0001$$$::It was warm. A gift that I wanted to savor.[r]::

